          "中转缓冲的两种策略与 gather / scatter 内核在 python/sglang/srt/disaggregation/common/staging_buffer.py:33 与 python/sglang/srt/disaggregation/common/staging_handler.py:886，本页只写它在主路径里的位置",
          "DCP 重排与 context parallel 的页号切分在 python/sglang/srt/disaggregation/common/dcp_pack.py:17 与 python/sglang/srt/disaggregation/utils.py:698，本页未展开",
          "PD 重试撤回（retraction / rebootstrap）的完整时序属于调度模块，本页只写 decode 侧的挂起释放与 prefill 侧的 requeue 入口",
